# Audit exclusions for `tama find-violations`: generated output and paths
# fixed by something outside this project.
#
# Xcode owns this file: it writes project.pbxproj whole whenever the example
# project changes, at exactly this path inside the .xcodeproj bundle, and the
# format has no include mechanism. A person never edits it by hand and it
# cannot be split without ceasing to be an Xcode project.
Example/Example.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
# The repository root. Every file below is read from the root by the
# tool named beside it, so none of them can move into a folder and the
# five-files-per-folder rule cannot be met here. Written by
# `tama declare-root`, which refuses to write this while the root still
# holds a file somebody could move.
#   .gitignore — git
#   LICENSE — GitHub reads the licence from the root
#   Package.swift — SwiftPM
